{
  "type": "tl494",
  "name": "PWM controller TL494",
  "category": "Power & interface",
  "prefix": "U",
  "description": "Pulse-width modulation controller (TL494, DIP-16): the oscillator runs at 1.1 / (RT x CT) with a 0-3 V sawtooth on CT; the output transistors (C1-E1, C2-E2) conduct while the sawtooth is above FEEDBACK (the higher of the two error amplifiers) and above DTC + 0.12 V; OUTPUT CTRL to GND drives both together, to REF (5 V) alternately (push-pull). Supply 7-40 V. Behavioral; its oscillator needs time steps well below its period (transient mode, or a low frequency)",
